      "text": "ArchiMate notation for the 'Stakeholder' element: a lavender box with bevelled corners and a stakeholder (cylinder-on-side) icon, labelled 'Stakeholder'. It is the symbol in the 'ArchiMate element' column of Table 3.1, 'The element types used in the DPI-H reference architecture and what they represent' (section 3.1).",
